graph TD
    %% Target Protein and Signals
    A[Target Protein Synthesis] --> B[Protein in Cytoplasm]
    C[Damage Signal] --> D[Misfolded Protein]
    E[Cell Cycle Signal] --> F[/Cyclin Degradation Signal/]
    G[Stress Signal] --> H[Stress Response Protein]
    
    B --> I{Protein Fate<br/>Decision?}
    D --> I
    F --> I
    H --> I
    
    %% Degron Recognition
    I -->|Degradation| J{Degron<br/>Present?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Degron Exposed]
    K --> L[E3 Ligase Recognition]
    
    %% E3 Ligase Types
    L --> M{Which E3<br/>Ligase?}
    M -->|SCF| N[SCF Complex Skp1-Cdc53-F-box]
    M -->|APC/C| O[APC/C Complex]
    M -->|HECT| P[HECT Domain E3]
    M -->|RING| Q[RING Domain E3]
    
    %% Ubiquitin Activation
    R[Free Ubiquitin] --> S[E1 Uba1 Enzyme]
    S --> T[ATP-Dependent Activation]
    T --> U[Ubiquitin-E1 Thioester]
    
    %% Ubiquitin Conjugation
    U --> V[E2 Ubc Enzyme]
    V --> W[Ubiquitin Transfer to E2]
    W --> X[Ubiquitin-E2 Thioester]
    
    %% E3-Mediated Ubiquitination
    N --> Y[Substrate-SCF Binding]
    O --> Y
    P --> Y
    Q --> Y
    
    X --> Y
    Y --> ANDGATE1{E2-Ub AND E3-Substrate<br/>AND Lysine Available?}
    
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| Z[Ubiquitin Transfer to Substrate]
    Z --> AA[Monoubiquitinated Protein]
    
    %% Polyubiquitin Chain Formation
    AA --> AB{Continue<br/>Ubiquitination?}
    AB -->|Yes| AC[K48-Linked Chain Extension]
    AC --> AD[Polyubiquitin Chain]
    AD --> AE{Chain Length<br/>≥ 4 Ubiquitins?}
    
    AE -->|Yes| AF[/K48-Ub4+ Degradation Signal/]
    AE -->|No| AB
    
    %% 26S Proteasome Recognition
    AF --> AG[19S Regulatory Particle Recognition]
    AG --> AH[Rpn10 Rpn13 Ubiquitin Receptors]
    AH --> AI{Substrate<br/>Committed?}
    
    AI --> ANDGATE2{Polyubiquitinated AND<br/>19S Bound?}
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| AJ[Substrate Engagement]
    
    %% Deubiquitination and Unfolding
    AJ --> AK[Rpn11 Deubiquitinase]
    AK --> AL[Ubiquitin Chain Removal]
    AL --> AM[Ubiquitin Recycling]
    AL --> AN[Substrate Unfolding]
    
    AN --> AO[AAA+ ATPase Ring]
    AO --> AP[ATP-Dependent Unfolding]
    AP --> AQ{Protein<br/>Unfolded?}
    
    AQ --> ANDGATE3{Unfolded AND<br/>20S Gate Open?}
    ANDGATE3 -->|Yes| AR[Translocation into 20S]
    
    %% Proteolysis
    AR --> AS[20S Catalytic Core]
    AS --> AT[Threonine Protease Activity]
    AT --> AU[Processive Proteolysis]
    AU --> AV[Peptide Products]
    AV --> AW[7-9 Amino Acid Peptides]
    
    %% Final Products
    AW --> AX[Peptide Release]
    AX --> AY[Cytoplasmic Peptidases]
    AY --> AZ[Free Amino Acids]
    
    AM --> BA[Ubiquitin Pool Replenishment]
    AZ --> BB[Amino Acid Pool]
    BB --> BC[Protein Synthesis or Metabolism]
    
    %% Alternative Fates
    I -->|Stable| BD[Functional Protein]
    J -->|No| BE[/Protein Escapes Degradation/]
    AI -->|No| BF[Substrate Release]
    AQ -->|No| BG[/Failed Degradation/]
    
